    53.0;                         !- PerimeterExposed {m}  Derived from: the sum of the bottom edges of the 1 exterior wall that stand on the floor of the zone (Mult_Class_1_Pod_1_ZN_1_FLR_1_Wall_1): 53 = 53 m.

