! HVAC system type of every zone from the xlsx (Zone and HVAC System Summary, HVAC System Type Dictionary): 7 VAV with reheat (chilled water cooling, hot-water fossil fuel boiler for the reheat) for the classroom pods, the corridors, the lobby, the bathrooms, the offices, the library and the mechanical rooms; 5 PSZ-AC (packaged rooftop air conditioner, constant volume, direct expansion cooling, fossil fuel furnace) for the gym, the auxiliary gym, the auditorium, the kitchen and the cafeteria. The xlsx names the HVAC system of each zone (raw_data column I): VAV_POD_1, VAV_POD_2, VAV_POD_3, VAV_OTHER, PSZ-AC_1:5, PSZ-AC_2:6, PSZ-AC_3:7, PSZ-AC_4:8 and PSZ-AC_5:9. All equipment data are EnergyPlus defaults.
! Three thermostats (xlsx Schedule Summary, Heating Set Point and Cooling Set Point): bathrooms and mechanical rooms (both set points of the space type Bathrooms, Mechanical Rooms), gym, auditorium, kitchen and cafeteria (heating set point of that space type, cooling set point Others) and all other zones (space type Others).
  HVACTemplate:Thermostat,
    OthersThermostat,             !- Name
    HTGSETP_SCH_VAV_OTHER,        !- Heating Setpoint Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Heating Set Point', rows 338/339/340 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun), space type Others.
    ,                             !- Constant Heating Setpoint
    CLGSETP_SCH_NO_SETBACK;       !- Cooling Setpoint Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Cooling Set Point', rows 329/330/331 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun), space type Others.

